[{'caption': 'Proof that building a canopy bed is way easier than it looks! Comment “canopy” and I’ll DM you a link to the exact kit I used 🌷', 'datetime': '2026-04-15T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '3875908619112371306', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/669941380_18314048923260047_4905838920241559284_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=-I_eG-oBdzkQ7kNvwHXnn0w&_nc_oc=AdqGMxMpGzHqsvkYVc418s4bHKReAsKk9xiRJNE30vSYjEtcZzN12J9_NiBp_PX2fh4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=kPzQSRH5odxU9qjUVCyAPw&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQRnqGAK0C2iPAEAE0O6jgv7aYC4lpe3Tt3fT2Wnez0uYQ&oe=6AED6013', 'post_hashtags': None, 'content_type': 'Video', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DXJ_lqIEVRq'}, {'caption': 'Being a Member of the @metmuseum has unlocked a whole new world for me. A world with Member Preview Days, where I get to experience new exhibitions before they’re open to the public. A world with Balcony Lounge access (my favorite place to grab a coffee and write a postcard), 15% off at The Met Store (where this gorgeous pearl brooch is from!), and invites to magical evening events like The Met After Hours with live music and drinks. 

Being a Member means I can pop in anytime and see over 5,000 years of art for free—all year long. To me, that’s one of the best parts of being a New Yorker.

Join now to experience next week’s Member Preview Days for ‘Raphael: Sublime Poetry.’ See you there? 

Use my special discount code, CLAUDIA10, for 10% off a Membership at the Individual or Dual level.

Video by @sheasalz', 'datetime': '2026-03-19T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '3856351640618632716', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/655457487_26334870796202675_8756333096365739799_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=dwkmKrM4gJYQ7kNvwFN5gT4&_nc_oc=AdoqEaj9K5AJXkfQmQgBm5TKSUIwKBzpJeVnz4E6dMzaijwcPUnytGn06raeI54bH48&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=kPzQSRH5odxU9qjUVCyAPw&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQSwpBkjKTOaZwvAjnd5v2NcNDnLQ_t77bjsCPYh2AjgCg&oe=6AED3CA4', 'post_hashtags': None, 'content_type': 'Video', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DWEg2KkEYYM'}, {'caption': 'If I had to describe my dream evening, it would probably involve wearing a pretty dress and running through the halls of a gorgeous old building. Thank you @godiva, for the indulgent, magical, chocolate-fueled evening ✨🍫', 'datetime': '2025-10-24T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '3750597653521596870', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/572042463_18291639238260047_3736029218915620382_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=_IZAdt2LVzYQ7kNvwEVuXTQ&_nc_oc=Adr6M0uoPuTW6NUBHPWzf5oL5Yp2dD2DIPUOq5l2tofhpGsQlKRMOKNO6KyPPOqhd0o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=kPzQSRH5odxU9qjUVCyAPw&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQQwdLva_OM1sbqdfxmO9XRKDnrR50IV3yfdOafabsr39Q&oe=6AED6F34', 'post_hashtags': None, 'content_type': 'Carousel', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DQMzLHBkYHG'}, {'caption': 'If your acceptance letter to Hogwarts got lost in the mail, I invite you to discover the places where Britain takes a starring role! @lovegreatbritain

