@thetempus_charltonhall', 'datetime': '2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4018123438887834071', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/870096929_18341054836260047_5202793955686223559_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=y4zwzzCfZn4Q7kNvwELCBgX&_nc_oc=AdoYumOaxuVRMuF5iJHlaEdggxtk220QC4JV7Wh6b346geFu4VLryEksJXF8IzJF6z4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=kPzQSRH5odxU9qjUVCyAPw&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQQ0jzVOKJ45AYPGQIdq84X_kWEzso5RVU-j1krJT90vkw&oe=6AED4704', 'post_hashtags': None, 'content_type': 'Carousel', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DfDPfqOlJHX'}, {'caption': 'A perfect morning in the English countryside. A cup of tea, my knitting, and Jane Austen movies on repeat. Just waiting for my very own Colonel Brandon ☕️🍂🕯️', 'datetime': '2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4017366803501578131', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/869528491_1392389679551433_8020326460589297028_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=FcDTmGO4bDAQ7kNvwGvgrGv&_nc_oc=AdpafEuYbs7eedDclvuD8jGe5D5VR38zgGKYzEksxJOGBq9LY4k5zZ00sPFjxhPPA3k&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=kPzQSRH5odxU9qjUVCyAPw&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQRx7NaK5cZvTCZBOUEsNcL6HNLCBg96DzUsqmXrglMgmg&oe=6AED4889', 'post_hashtags': None, 'content_type': 'Video', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DfAjdKnKHeT'}, {'caption': 'If you’re looking for a magical destination that feels like something out of the pages of a storybook, North Wales is your answer. @lovegreatbritain 

The coastline, the dramatic scenery, the cozy historic pubs. There is so much to see and do, but here are just a few of my favorites!

- @bodysgallenhallspa: a historic estate with cozy rooms, enchanting gardens, and sweeping views. It feels just like something out of the pages of The Magician’s Nephew

- @thebullbeaumaris: a 15th-century, cozy inn on Anglesey’s magical coastline 

- @snowdonmountainrailway: a wonder-filled journey that takes you to the summit of Snowdon, where you can take in dramatic scenery that inspired House of the Dragon

- @georgeanddragonbeaumaris: one of the oldest pubs in Wales, a perfect place to enjoy fresh local lobster or crab

- @love_signatures: a true hidden gem in the middle of North Wales

