#halloween #superman #explore #superhero #instagram', 'datetime': '2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4016796431373916175', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/867126352_18448987054135268_6306164016352995680_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=lIb8nuilzf4Q7kNvwGc8UfU&_nc_oc=Ado8PwkmK5uoUZ-7-j6vBf_QIUz3UP-srosLPPSOILJ0qvXU9XS4eqMNJk1mRCL1jbk&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-phl2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=O-8I9C011a2Tv103rXWEqg&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQSmbSyfz2fgQQezdGWo6LNe5tGhEDjUL0Y5jfGHXdgF-w&oe=6AED3FF9', 'post_hashtags': ['halloween', 'superman', 'explore', 'superhero', 'instagram'], 'content_type': 'Carousel', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/De-hxKLGVgP'}, {'caption': 'Canon event.

It’s crazy how much your life can change in just a few years. 2023 was one of the darkest periods of my life. I experienced betrayal and went through things I wouldn’t wish on anyone. Things that completely broke me and changed the way I saw myself, other people, and the world around me. For a long time, I felt like I’d lost a part of who I was. 

There were moments when I barely recognized myself anymore, and I carried feelings I didn’t know how to put into words. 

What started as a way to cope with everything I was going through eventually became something I genuinely fell in love with. I poured so much of myself into becoming stronger, both physically and mentally. Three years later, I can look back and see just how much has changed. Not just in the mirror, but in the person I’ve become. 

I’ve learned that no matter how much someone makes you question your worth, they don’t get to decide what you’re worth. 

To anyone going through their own difficult chapter, don’t let what happened to you determine who you become. You have no idea what you’re capable of until you give yourself the chance to find out.

