Michelle (no insta)', 'datetime': '2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4018324461937884211', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-dfw5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/870167679_18474508648141925_5938936919013669132_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=wP2kdpu8b8QQ7kNvwE-gCvX&_nc_oc=AdrSvkfj0eDz2IO5Dfcpj_c3OXUMmXWxLvOh93oZycuxs0D1qWUmqr-zbzk-8hVpsFE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=m_4NZPVqPHidPoLGjDSf2g&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQT2Oh1eRaMwla6YNNMyXsP41XgBFq0mt-9gY-DPakrAAw&oe=6AED4072', 'post_hashtags': ['5'], 'content_type': 'Carousel', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DfD9M7iEfwz'}, {'caption': 'Someone told me to do better… what do you think, did I? 

I started this project last year and it has been one of the hardest things to pull off. So many people told me to make the mold smaller or why even try at all. Wasn’t able to get enough glass on the pipe last year. I’ve had to learn so many new skills to control that much glass. Used a full bar of R-71 mandarin orange from @olympiccolors and a 2.5” blow pipe from @spiralartstools 

Thank you to all the people I’ve bounced ideas off of and thank you to my team for putting up with my crazy ideas!! Love you all 💛 

Ps I like yellow 

#glassblowing #giantpumpkin #blownglass #worldrecord #thegreatpumpkin', 'datetime': '2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4017033409456352768', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-dfw6-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/866531033_1466893498751322_7211671583670821563_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=1&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=OjPekNT7GKAQ7kNvwG7j-DX&_nc_oc=Adod2Lpxaz_5Eb40BrLv7ovX4Q6J8eFMSgEEsBq9mohrR2LU75ZCEq9QH0a7fmOppjc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=m_4NZPVqPHidPoLGjDSf2g&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQSSbDs1xyMT4rbeVHP96M557Br9FN5B_kOqFpwVJEcqOQ&oe=6AED3D01', 'post_hashtags': ['glassblowing', 'giantpumpkin', 'blownglass', 'worldrecord', 'thegreatpumpkin'], 'content_type': 'Video', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/De_XppNha4A'}, {'caption': 'How can we do it better? 

This is our 5th attempt at the largest glass pumpkin.  31 inches wide and 97 inches around.

Gathered till it maxed out the furnace opening then into a 15 pound stuff cup. 

#worldslargest #glasspumpkin #glassblowing #thegreatpumpkin', 'datetime': '2026-10-25T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4016251709952494542', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/869628210_1161162826575209_1704117389553752969_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=r8_J2ZMigT8Q7kNvwFElJmf&_nc_oc=Adqh5gcGu0I2ICfTIgqgFOV6PpjUaju7lcihpICTVxJ5DRNh3_omyzBnR5veMfGTuYM&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=m_4NZPVqPHidPoLGjDSf2g&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQQgu4-TywEboulQZ3M1T0XuZt-mmV8NEl4ZlmyqV7mXEA&oe=6AED5870', 'post_hashtags': ['worldslargest', 'glasspumpkin', 'glassblowing', 'thegreatpumpkin'], 'content_type': 'Video', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/De8l6a0RgvO'}, {'caption': 'Final gather for the giant pumpkin!! Don’t worry I still got more glass in the form of a stuff cup. Total weight ended up being 45 pounds of glass. On a 14 pound blow pipe

Also check out this 2.5” @spiralartstools blow pipe @johnmillerhotglass let me use. It’s a monster!! 
