[{'caption': "[TICKETS IN BIO] We saw how much you guys loved @onthe_easel so we’re taking over NYC's @focalpointbeer in Long Island City for an exclusive Secret Club mosaic workshop next month 👨‍🎨✨⁠And we even got a special price on tickets 🎟️ 
⁠
This is a chance for New Yorkers to tap into their creative sides and design two custom drink coasters out of mosaic tiles 🎨 We are providing all the materials and, most importantly, your ticket comes with beer and tacos!⁠

Join our special membership program @secretclubglobal to get access to this event and tons of other perks ✨
⁠
Here are all the details:⁠
📍 Focal Point Beer Co at 43-50 12th St, LIC⁠
📆  Friday, Nov 13 from 6:30 PM to 8:30 PM⁠
🎟️ Inside the Secret Club, found at the link in our bio! #secretclub", 'datetime': '2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4003685956057950508', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/840070246_18570289099075674_1456715441183628060_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=Vhyxh7WC14kQ7kNvwErUr0Z&_nc_oc=AdrbFNLxh_Vfe2GAxcbwPxHY3eJ-CEuoOZulhgvHByFcfVVErs0-eR1uGyth8RuyHL4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mxdCQbaz3xDJRyNeXUrG0g&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQQmVYSwZ4WB39qFqzlUSsNW5naWyTJYah-QZUegWIOhjQ&oe=6AED6F44', 'post_hashtags': ['secretclub'], 'content_type': 'Video', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DeP8yojDeks'}, {'caption': '[LINK IN BIO] Here is the ultimate guide to the best things to do in NYC this October. 🍂🎃

From tracking fall foliage in Central Park to massive Halloween street parties, autumn is officially in full swing across all five boroughs. Exploring the best things to do in NYC this October makes planning your weekends easy, gathering all the top seasonal events, food pop-ups, and outdoor markets in one place.

🎃 The Highlights: Experience immersive Halloween events, Village parades, and cozy autumn markets.

🍂 The Outdoors: Track peak fall foliage, visit nearby pumpkin patches, or catch an outdoor movie under the crisp autumn air.

Hit the link in our bio for the complete list of seasonal events, dates, and ticket details.

What is your favorite fall activity in the city? 👇

📸 Shutterstock / Getty Images / Stephanie Keith / Open House New York & Ben Helmer / Krisanne Johnson / Diwali Times Square / Zum Schneider / DonTheMoment

📍 New York City (New York)

#lifestyle 

On Halloween night, Sixth Avenue becomes New York at its most gloriously unhinged. The Village Halloween Parade returns for its 53rd year on Saturday, October 31, filling the route with giant puppets, marching bands, dancers, fire-breathing creations, and tens of thousands of people who spent far too long perfecting their costumes.

This year’s theme is “Body & Soul,” an invitation to go beyond the standard store-bought vampire cape and wear something that shows off your weirdest, brightest, most imaginative self.

The parade is one of the world’s largest participatory Halloween events, and anyone in costume can join the procession as long as you’re in a costume!
Want to watch instead? Stake out a spot along Sixth Avenue early, especially around the Village, where the crowd gets thick fast.

The parade starts at Canal Street and heads north to 15th Street, with more than 50,000 marchers expected to take part.

The 64th New York Film Festival turns Lincoln Center into a red-carpet hotspot from September 25 through October 12, with 32 films from 31 countries in its Main Slate alone.

This year’s must-watch premieres include James Gray’s Paper Tiger, opening the festival with Scarlett Johansson, Adam', 'datetime': '2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '3998533908191777586', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-lax7-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/831192916_18568399798075674_8653684412947272772_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=CdABlSG_FmkQ7kNvwFP6g_n&_nc_oc=Adrs1vZwnwyJTFBDse8QjQeQbSXgKGsQdbzUnJbAmEpR6PWhcdYFnaIb9UDKqDN1RKY&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lax7-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mxdCQbaz3xDJRyNeXUrG0g&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQRxyZVe9CI81xue1oPPMjumTFsPIZlbXfgpD_gXU1J3RA&oe=6AED5CA4', 'post_hashtags': ['lifestyle'], 'content_type': 'Carousel', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd9pWeEIBMy'}, {'caption': 'Another round of marathon madness - these signs are insane and the vibes are immaculate! 

